    小径为一道厚重铁门所阻。门上方镌刻着：<br><p>
    每面必至少说一句真话。<br><p>
    门上三尊黄铜面像低语：<br>    ONE: The gold key does not open the door. Gymer's only son is Kizler.<br>    TWO: The gold key does not open the door. Gymer's only son is Aubyn.<br>    THREE: The copper key does not open the door. The silver key opens the door.<br><p>
    门旁悬着三把钥匙。你思忖，误用一钥恐触发机关，遂取而试之……<br><p><opt>...<indent>金钥匙。<br><opt>...<indent>银钥匙。<br><opt>...<indent>铜钥匙。<br><opt>...<indent>全无——你转身离去。
